<div class="wpc-quiz-demo-options wpc-keren-loan-h3k9-quiz-options edit-hoverable"><label class="wpc-quiz-demo-option wpc-keren-loan-h3k9-quiz-option"> <input name="q3" type="radio" value="cashflow"> <span class="wpc-quiz-demo-text wpc-keren-loan-h3k9-quiz-text edit-hoverable">תזרים חודשי נמוך (ללא תשלומים)</span> </label> <label class="wpc-quiz-demo-option wpc-keren-loan-h3k9-quiz-option"> <input name="q3" type="radio" value="total"> <span class="wpc-quiz-demo-text wpc-keren-loan-h3k9-quiz-text edit-hoverable">סה"כ ריבית נמוכה יותר</span> </label></div>
